   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operationalizing the COAG Sub-Committee on Livestock and supporting its multi-year programme of work</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the operationalization of the COAG Sub-Committee on Livestock and its multi-year programme of work. This programme of work will include biennial sessions of the COAG Sub-Committee on Livestock, technical workshops, and preparation of global assessments and technical documents. The outcome of this project will be a functional intergovernmental forum that allows FAO Members to discuss and build consensus on issues and priorities related to the livestock sector, thus advising COAG and through it, FAO Council and Conference.</narrative>
  </description>
